---

## Branch Naming Convention
- Format: `feature/<kebab-case-description>`
- Base branch: `development`
- One sub-task = one branch
- Do not start a row whose predecessor is still open (status ≠ Completed ✅)

## Status Values
- ⬜ Pending - Not started
- 🔄 In Progress - Actively working
- 👀 In Review - PR open, awaiting review
- ✅ Completed - Merged to development
- ❌ Blocked - Waiting on predecessor or external dependency

## Update Rule
Set the row to `Completed ✅` only after that sub-task has merged to `development`.